Teacher!

00:50:47.540 --> 00:50:50.300
What I want to hear is not a lullaby!

00:50:50.980 --> 00:50:52.790
I want you to teach me the ultimate magic!

00:50:55.820 --> 00:50:56.340
Teacher!

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:00.560
I'm sorry.

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:34.470
Why don't you teach me the ultimate magic, sensei?

00:51:34.470 --> 00:51:37.170
I've been trying so hard...

00:51:37.170 --> 00:51:37.710
I...

00:51:37.770 --> 00:51:40.400
Are you listening to me, sensei?

00:51:40.480 --> 00:51:41.400
Stop it!

00:51:41.580 --> 00:51:43.020
Stop it!

00:51:46.940 --> 00:51:58.180
It seems that it was my misunderstanding that she was hated.

00:52:00.600 --> 00:52:05.160
I just want to be praised by the teacher.

00:52:09.870 --> 00:52:12.240
I know that.

00:52:12.900 --> 00:52:18.480
Are you grumbling?

00:52:32.010 --> 00:52:33.070
Itadakimashita yo!

00:52:33.190 --> 00:52:34.580
Pricure's Tears!

00:52:35.340 --> 00:52:38.200
Sorciel-sama.

00:52:38.760 --> 00:52:40.380
Actually, the Pricure's Tears...

00:52:40.380 --> 00:52:41.300
...are not meant to be used against Sensei.

00:52:43.480 --> 00:52:43.880
Eh?

00:52:46.840 --> 00:52:48.720
Everything is meant to release your power!

00:52:49.320 --> 00:52:52.450
The power that was sealed away by your sensei...

00:52:52.450 --> 00:52:53.240
...is mine!

00:52:54.800 --> 00:52:55.020
Ni!

00:53:02.240 --> 00:53:03.720
Finally, the drug has been completed!

00:53:04.640 --> 00:53:10.060
Now I can finally return to my original form!

00:53:11.180 --> 00:53:11.740
Darkness!

00:53:12.140 --> 00:53:16.310
Let the tears of the Flickera absorb the power of light and be released!

00:53:17.250 --> 00:53:26.520
Here it comes, here it comes!

00:54:30.320 --> 00:54:34.360
Invincible. Invincible of everything.

00:55:00.670 --> 00:55:01.830
I'm being swallowed by the darkness!

00:55:02.030 --> 00:55:03.520
Let's go, Magical!

00:55:03.680 --> 00:55:05.710
Stop, Trauma!

00:55:05.850 --> 00:55:08.120
How could you do such a terrible thing?

00:55:09.170 --> 00:55:09.830
Terrible?

00:55:10.050 --> 00:55:12.540
Is that what you're saying?

00:55:12.920 --> 00:55:13.400
What?

00:55:14.420 --> 00:55:18.780
Remember what you've done so far!

00:55:19.160 --> 00:55:27.560
What's the difference between you and me?

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:33.520
What's wrong with you?

00:55:33.940 --> 00:55:47.460
I have no choice but to go!

00:55:47.500 --> 00:55:49.820
One, two, three!

00:55:50.160 --> 00:55:51.590
Torikyo!

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:14.560
But, what do you have left?

00:56:15.000 --> 00:56:15.320
I'll be back!

00:56:33.450 --> 00:56:36.470
What's going on, Trevor?

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:00.180
La

00:57:00.180 --> 00:57:02.710
Lula

00:57:02.710 --> 00:57:17.840
Why? Why am I standing here at this time?

00:57:18.280 --> 00:57:23.920
When I sang that melody, I got energy

00:57:30.480 --> 00:57:39.080
DUNA DUNA DUNA DUNA

00:58:02.240 --> 00:58:05.270
Lululala

00:58:09.800 --> 00:58:15.260
I want it

00:58:43.000 --> 00:58:55.160
What are you doing?

00:59:00.960 --> 00:59:09.760
I want you to take care of me

00:59:31.760 --> 00:59:33.480
My hair is also amazing

01:00:00.320 --> 01:00:00.420
A witch?

01:00:00.680 --> 01:00:07.480
The light

01:00:07.480 --> 01:00:10.180
The wand of magic

01:00:32.108 --> 01:00:33.348
That light is...

01:01:10.140 --> 01:01:12.140
Thank you for watching!

01:01:31.500 --> 01:01:32.460
Ah, uh...

01:02:00.800 --> 01:02:01.740
Let's go, everyone!

01:02:02.240 --> 01:02:07.010
No matter how many people there are, it's the same.

01:02:33.836 --> 01:02:35.836
Thank you for watching.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:30.500
Tell me!

01:05:46.310 --> 01:05:47.130
We have to get rid of the power of the Precure!

01:06:05.760 --> 01:06:09.800
You're a weirdo!

01:06:09.990 --> 01:06:10.050
You're a weirdo!

01:06:10.350 --> 01:06:12.230
You're a weirdo!

01:07:04.220 --> 01:07:05.000
I'm really sorry.

01:07:05.700 --> 01:07:09.100
I'll tell you my feelings.

01:07:10.600 --> 01:07:11.320
That's what I meant.

01:07:11.440 --> 01:07:15.280
My feelings?

01:07:21.800 --> 01:07:24.680
If you'll forgive me, someday...

01:07:24.680 --> 01:07:29.130
Just like you did, I'll cast a spell on the children.

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:31.380
I want to do a job that conveys magic.

01:07:31.980 --> 01:07:34.110
Do your best!

01:07:34.390 --> 01:07:47.200
Once again, a thorough investigation of Precure!

01:07:47.220 --> 01:07:48.510
Kuukumon!

01:07:49.800 --> 01:07:52.090
How can you use magic?

01:07:52.350 --> 01:07:56.840
I can use magic!

01:08:01.340 --> 01:08:06.380
Tell me the order!

01:10:00.220 --> 01:10:00.440
Yeah.
